em to keep still\n[02:26.90]I been smoking all the pain away\n[02:29.50]I got an emotional umbrella, 'cause I'ma keep all the rain away\n[Verse 3]\n[02:34.36]Yeah, and I love poppin' molly, I love poppin' molly (Yeah)\n[02:41.92]Uh, I'm in love with the molly, can't nobody stop me\n[02:47.32]I feel like DeJ Loaf, 'cause ain't nobody gon try me\n[02:52.92]And I'm checking these bitches, they calling me Nike\n[Bridge]\n[02:57.32]But back to me and you though\n[03:00.42]Are you saying kudos?\n[03:03.12]Are you saying goodbye?\n[03:04.22]Are you saying hello?\n[03:08.62]Do we need to hold hands?\n[03:11.36]Do I need to let it go?\n[03:14.20]I'ma hit the train on her\n[03:16.82]And I ain't talking metro\n[Verse 4]\n[03:19.46]I'm back on my old shit\n[03:21.74]Hit the same shit before you came\n[03:24.84]And they calling me the young Prince\n[03:27.00]So when I blow smoke it's Purple Rain\n[03:29.60]Now what the fuck these niggas want from me?\n[03:32.14]'Cause I'm finna get all dummy\n[03:35.68]You told me that I could run the world\n[03:38.00]So what I'ma do, I'ma keep running\n[Interlude]\n[03:40.42]And we're strolling and strolling and strolling and strolling (Yeah)\n[03:47.90]Mama I'm roamin', it's roamin', it's roamin', it's roamin'\n[03:53.28]And I keep on zonin' and zonin' and zonin' and zonin'\n[03:57.34]My mind's on you, you already know it, you know it, you know it, you know it\n[Verse 5]\n[04:03.70]I know you see the fucking struggle, yeah\n[04:06.46]I know you see my fucking hustle, yeah\n[04:09.04]I been flexing on your exes too (Ha)\n[04:11.68]Girl, you know you love my fucking muscles\n[04:14.46]And I'm trying to reach the fucking top\n[04:17.18]Trying to get on another level\n[04:19.08]I'm just trying to get a white wrist\n[04:21.98]Full of diamonds and a fucking bezel\n[04:25.38]And you know that I'm seeing shit\n[04:28.30]And I keep on seeing it\n[04:31.34]Me and you is what I dream of\n[04:33.74]That's that mission completed shit\n[04:36.56]And you know that I'm too high\n[04:39.28]Yeah, my vision is blurry\n[04:42.44]Ever since you left me\n[04:43.92]Yeah, ever since you left me\n[Verse 6]\n[04:47.58]Yeah, you know I keep tweaking\n[04:49.04]I been reachin' new highs\n[04:53.14]I been smokin' and leanin'\n[04:55.28]I been reachin' new highs\n[04:58.48]And I been coolin' with the wrong crowd\n[05:01.00]Quote on quote “coolin' with the cool guys”\n[05:04.32]And you been on my ass now\n[05:06.48]Shit, I don't even know why\n[Outro]\n[05:10.88]Is this hello?\n[05:12.94]Is this goodbye?\n[05:16.08]Are you trying to play me?\n[05:17.84]If so, nice try\n[05:21.90]And if you didn't know, baby girl I'm too high\n[05:27.44]Is this hello, is this goodbye?\n[05:31.62]Is this goodbye?","words":[[7.12,7.4,"Uh,"],[7.44,7.5,"yeah,"],[7.54,7.58,"uh"],[7.62,7.62,"I"],[7.66,7.78,"ain't"],[7.82,8.0,"write"],[8.1,8.2,"this"],[8.24,8.38,"down,"],[8.44,8.44,"I"],[8.48,8.58,"ain't"],[8.62,8.7,"write"],[8.74,8.8,"this"],[8.84,8.92,"down"],[8.96,8.98,"Oh"],[9.02,9.04,"no,"],[9.08,9.14,"no"],[9.18,9.18,"I"],[9.24,9.46,"ain't"],[9.5,9.62,"write"],[9.66,9.74,"this"],[9.78,10.0,"down,"],[10.04,10.06,"no"],[10.4,10.44,"And"],[10.48,10.54,"you"],[10.62,10.84,"always"],[10.88,10.98,"find,"],[11.14,11.16,"uh"],[11.2,13.84,"And"],[19.94,20.0,"you"],[20.18,20.7,"always"],[20.74,24.08,"find,"],[24.28,24.36,"and"],[24.4,24.58,"you"],[24.62,24.82,"always"],[24.9,25.48,"find"],[26.6,29.86,"something"],[29.9,30.08,"wrong"],[30.12,30.16,"And"],[30.2,30.2,"I"],[30.28,30.36,"been"],[30.46,30.66,"blaming"],[30.7,30.72,"it"],[30.86,30.94,"on"],[30.98,31.4,"myself"],[31.48,31.62,"for"],[31.8,32.22,"way"],[32.42,32.54,"too"],[32.62,33.0,"long"],[33.24,35.0,"I'm"],[35.12,35.2,"so"],[35.44,35.78,"gifted"],[35.82,35.84,"at"],[35.94,36.52,"finding"],[36.82,36.92,"who"],[37.5,37.78,"does"],[37.84,37.9,"the"],[38.0,38.38,"most"],[40.62,40.68,"So"],[40.9,40.9,"I"],[40.96,41.18,"think"],[41.26,41.38,"it's"],[41.46,41.88,"time"],[42.1,42.22,"for"],[42.3,42.38,"me"],[4